DLC_Dat["Stonethorn"]={}
DLC_Dat["Stonethorn"].name="Stonethorn"
DLC_Dat["Stonethorn"].dat={
2694, -- Stone Garden Vanquisher,  Defeat Exarch Kraglen, the Stone Behemoth, and Arkasis the Mad Alchemist in Stone Garden.
2695, -- Stone Garden Conqueror,  Defeat Exarch Kraglen, the Stone Behemoth, and Arkasis the Mad Alchemist in Veteran Stone Garden.
2697, -- Expeditious Experimenter,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Exarch Kraglen, the Stone Behemoth, and Arkasis the Mad Alchemist within 25 minutes of entering Veteran Stone Garden. Your timer starts on engaging the first group of Stone Garden's defenders. Accessing the Vitalizer Control Rooms is not required.
2698, -- Safety First!,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Exarch Kraglen, the Stone Behemoth, and Arkasis the Mad Alchemist in Veteran Stone Garden without suffering a group member death. Accessing the Vitalizer Control Rooms is not required.
2700, -- Stone Garden Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Stone Garden.
2701, -- True Genius,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Exarch Kraglen, the Stone Behemoth, and Arkasis the Mad Alchemist after raising the challenge banner for each in Veteran Stone Garden within 25 minutes without suffering a group member death. Accessing the Vitalizer Control Rooms is not required. Your timer starts upon engaging the first group of enemies.
2704, -- Castle Thorn Vanquisher,  Defeat Dread Tindulra, the Blood Twilight, Vaduroth, Talfyg, and Lady Thorn in Castle Thorn.
2705, -- Castle Thorn Conqueror,  Defeat Dread Tindulra, the Blood Twilight, Vaduroth, Talfyg, and Lady Thorn in Veteran Castle Thorn.
2706, -- Thorn Remover,  Defeat Lady Thorn after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Castle Thorn.
2707, -- Homewrecker,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Dread Tindulra, the Blood Twilight, Vaduroth, Talfyg, and Lady Thorn within 30 minutes of entering Veteran Castle Thorn. Your timer starts when you engage the first group of enemies.
2708, -- Impervious Onslaught,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Dread Tindulra, the Blood Twilight, Vaduroth, Talfyg, and Lady Thorn in Veteran Castle Thorn without suffering a group member death.
2709, -- Castle Thorn Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Castle Thorn.
2710, -- Bane of Thorns,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Dread Tindulra, the Blood Twilight, Vaduroth, Talfyg, and Lady Thorn after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Castle Thorn within 30 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts upon engaging the first group of enemies.
2711, -- Stonethorn Delver,  Complete both Stone Garden and Castle Thorn in Veteran.
2753, -- Restrained the Hounds,  Defeat Exarch Kraglen after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Stone Garden.
2754, -- Still Needs Work,  Defeat the Stone Behemoth after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Stone Garden.
2755, -- Triple Checked,  Defeat Exarch Kraglen, the Stone Behemoth, and Arkasis the Mad Alchemist in Veteran Stone Garden after placing the challenge banner for each of them.
2808, -- Maximum Tantrum,  Defeat Exarch Kraglen after acquiring three or more stacks of Blood Rage and Fracture in Veteran Stone Garden.
2809, -- Fulgurite Forger,  Strike the Stone Behemoth with Arkasis's Lightning Generator 30 times in Veteran Stone Garden.
2811, -- Hound Pound,  Defeat Dread Tindulra and kill her Broodlings while they are at least 15 meters apart in Veteran Castle Thorn.
2813, -- Four by Four,  Defeat Vaduroth after each group member bursts at least one imbued hanging corpse with the sickle in Veteran Castle Thorn.
2815, -- Let Sleeping Gargoyles Lie,  Defeat Talfyg without killing any of the large Frozen Gargoyles during his encounter in Veteran Castle Thorn.
2823, -- Spore Stomper,  Defeat Arkasis the Mad Alchemist after preventing the Stone Husks from releasing any Volatile Gloomspores in Veteran Stone Garden.
2824, -- Old Fashioned,  Defeat Arkasis the Mad Alchemist after raising the challenge banner without deactivating the vitalizer flow controls or gaining the benefits of using Arkasis's alchemy equipment throughout the entire run of Veteran Stone Garden.
2826, -- Methodical Mixologist,  Use Arkasis's alchemy equipment to gain the benefits of Alchemized Super Strength, Alchemized Super Vigor, and Alchemized Super Resilience and have all three active at the same time in Stone Garden.
2827, -- Taking Turns,  Defeat Lady Thorn after completing both bat swarm phases where each player used the Blood Scavenger synergy at least once per phase in Veteran Castle Thorn.
2828, -- Guardian Preserved,  Defeat Lady Thorn after raising the challenge banner without killing the Blood Guardian in Veteran Castle Thorn.
2862, -- Stonethorn Scout,  Complete both Castle Thorn and Stone Garden in Normal.
